@startuml SQ04_Manage_Personal_Info
title UC04 - Manage Personal Information Sequence Diagram
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "User" as User #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nProfilePage" as ProfilePage #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nAccountProfileController" as ProfileController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nAccountProfileServiceImpl" as ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAccountRepository" as AccountRepository #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAccountInformationRepository" as AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAuditLogRepository" as AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

== Phase 1: Retrieve Personal Profile ==
activate User #7ACFF5
User -> ProfilePage: Navigate to Profile page (/profile)
activate ProfilePage #7ACFF5

ProfilePage -> ProfileController: GET /api/v1/profile (Bearer AT)
activate ProfileController #7ACFF5

ProfileController -> ProfileServiceImpl: getProfile(accountId)
activate ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountRepository: findById(accountId)
activate AccountRepository #7ACFF5
AccountRepository -> DB: SELECT a FROM accounts a LEFT JOIN FETCH a.accountInformation WHERE a.id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountRepository: Account with AccountInformation
deactivate DB
AccountRepository --> ProfileServiceImpl: Account
deactivate AccountRepository

ProfileServiceImpl --> ProfileController: ProfileResponse (fullName, phone, avatar, role, storeName)
deactivate ProfileServiceImpl

ProfileController --> ProfilePage: HTTP 200 OK + ProfileResponse
deactivate ProfileController

ProfilePage --> User: Display Profile Form with populated fields

== Phase 2: Update Personal Profile ==
User -> ProfilePage: Edit fullName, phone, upload avatar, click "Save Changes"
ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Validate phone format (10 VN digits)

ProfilePage -> ProfileController: PUT /api/v1/profile (UpdateProfileRequest, Bearer AT)
activate ProfileController #7ACFF5

ProfileController -> ProfileServiceImpl: updateProfile(accountId, UpdateProfileRequest)
activate ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountInfoRepo: findByAccount_Id(accountId)
activate AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
AccountInfoRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM account_informations WHERE account_id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountInfoRepo: AccountInformation entity
deactivate DB
AccountInfoRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: AccountInformation
deactivate AccountInfoRepo

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountInfoRepo: Update fullName, phone, avatar, address
activate AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
AccountInfoRepo -> DB: UPDATE account_informations SET full_name=?, phone=?, avatar=? WHERE id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountInfoRepo: OK
deactivate DB
AccountInfoRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: OK
deactivate AccountInfoRepo

ProfileServiceImpl -> AuditLogRepo: save(AuditLog 'UPDATE_PROFILE_SUCCESS')
activate AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
AuditLogRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (...)
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AuditLogRepo: OK
deactivate DB
AuditLogRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: OK
deactivate AuditLogRepo

ProfileServiceImpl --> ProfileController: Updated ProfileResponse
deactivate ProfileServiceImpl

ProfileController --> ProfilePage: HTTP 200 OK + ProfileResponse
deactivate ProfileController

ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Synchronize avatar in Header Context State
ProfilePage --> User: Display Toast "Cập nhật hồ sơ cá nhân thành công!"

deactivate ProfilePage
deactivate User
@enduml
